%!PS
/r { 0 0 3 -1 roll 1 rectfill } def
/b { { 1 } { 0 } ifelse r } def
/s { length r } def
/e { stopped b } def
/a [1 2 3 4 5] def a 1 3 getinterval /c exch def c 0 99 put a 1 get r c 0 get r
a 2 77 put c 1 get r a s c s
/str (abcdef) def str 2 3 getinterval /v exch def v s v 0 get r
str 0 (XY) putinterval str 0 get r v 0 get r
/arr 5 array def arr 1 [7 8] putinterval arr 2 get r
{ a 4 3 getinterval } e { a -1 1 getinterval } e { 5 0 1 getinterval } e
{ a 4 [1 2] putinterval } e { a 0 (x) putinterval } e { str 0 [1] putinterval } e { str 9 (x) putinterval } e
